    "homepage": "https://wordpress.org/themes/expert-sports-coach/",
    "sections": {
        "description": "Expert Sports Coach is a professional WordPress theme designed for sports coaches to display their expertise by creating an online presence. This theme provides an ideal platform for showcasing expertise, services, and achievements in a visually appealing and organized manner. The theme comes with a modern and sleek layout and ensures that your website looks both stylish and professional, thus, helping you to attract potential clients. The Expert Sports Coach WordPress Theme is ideal for coaches at all levels, from personal trainers to team coaches and sports academies. It offers a range of customization options using which you can personalize the fonts, background images and colours theme of your website. This theme also helps you highlight your unique skills, training programs, client testimonials, and success stories. You can display them either in the form of blogs or image banners. Its intuitive layout ensures that visitors can easily navigate through your content and find all the information they are looking for. The theme is fully responsive and cross-browser compatible, Multiple Color Option, Multiple Font Families, Typography, One Click Demo Importer, Breadcrumbs, Heading Banners, Blog Layouts, Theme Layouts, Animations, Translation ready, meaning potential students can access your website with ease through all types of devices and web browsers. Additionally, it is also translation-ready and allows the text on your website to be translated to multiple languages so your visitors can navigate through your website in the language of their choice."
    },
